UnitPaymentStateLib
├── when checking the hub table
│   ├── given the pair is one of the four edges
│   │   └── it allows the transition
│   ├── given any other of the 25 pairs
│   │   └── it rejects the transition
│   └── given fuzzed pairs within the enum range
│       └── it allows only the four edges
└── when checking the receiver table
    ├── given the pair is one of the three edges
    │   └── it allows the transition
    └── given any other of the 16 pairs
        └── it rejects the transition
